<title>SRI LANKA: Kotagala says 1996 net up 23.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Kotagala says 1996 net up 23.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Kotagala Plantations Ltd for the 12 months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1996		    1995</p>
<p>Turnover		  810.37   vs	   726.38</p>
<p>     Net profit	 140.07   vs	   113.68</p>
<p>NOTE - Kotagala Plantations Ltd is one of six privatised estate firms listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
